@TestServer_HostAddress = https://localhost:7020
@ApiKey = replace-with-your-api-key
@AdminApiKey = replace-with-your-admin-api-key

GET {{TestServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health/live
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

GET {{TestServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/server/info
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Power operations are disabled by default

POST {{TestServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/power/restart
X-Admin-API-Key: {{AdminApiKey}}

### Legacy command endpoint

POST {{TestServer_HostAddress}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "message": "Ping"
}

### Legacy power commands require both keys and an enabled operation

POST {{TestServer_HostAddress}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-Admin-API-Key: {{AdminApiKey}}

{
  "message": "Shutdown Linux machine"
}
